  "target": "src.api.report_view:ReportView",
  "diagnosis": "The class exhibits low cohesion (LCOM4=2) because its methods operate on two distinct sets of attributes: `title` and `describe_customer` rely on `self._width`, while `order_count` and `mail_summary` rely on `self._repository` and `self._mailer`. Additionally, `describe_customer` displays feature envy by accessing four attributes of the `Customer` object, suggesting that formatting logic should reside closer to the data. The class also has a moderate dependency count (DCC=2) on `OrderRepository` and `EmailClient`.",
  "suggestions": [
    {
      "title": "Extract formatting logic to a dedicated Formatter class",
      "rationale_metric_link": [
        "LCOM4",
        "DCC"
      ],
      "expected_effect": [
